.TH OBLIQUITY 1 "" "Obliquity" "Obliquity Manual"
.SH NAME
obliquity \- staged orchestration of feroxbuster, ffuf, hashcat, and thc-hydra
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B obliquity
.I command
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Obliquity is a CLI that orchestrates penetration\-testing tools in four pillars \-\- bust (feroxbuster), fuzz (ffuf), crack (hashcat), brute (thc\-hydra) \-\- with projects, staged gameplans, resume, and unified reporting. Each pillar only needs its own tool installed.
.SH OVERVIEW
.TP
.B obliquity <command> \-\-help
detailed help for any command
.TP
.B obliquity console
interactive REPL \-\- type commands without the 'obliquity' prefix
.TP
.B obliquity doctor
check that feroxbuster/ffuf/hashcat/hydra are installed
.SH PROJECTS & HOSTS
One project groups many hosts/jobs, results, and settings.
.TP
.B obliquity project create acme
create a project
.TP
.B obliquity project use acme
make it the active project (so you can omit its name)
.TP
.B obliquity project list
list projects with host/job/run counts
.TP
.B obliquity project current
show the active project: hosts, metadata, per\-tool gameplans, options
.TP
.B obliquity project unset
clear the active project
.TP
.B obliquity project archive acme \-\-yes
back up files + drop the DB record
.TP
.B obliquity project delete acme \-\-yes
permanently delete (no backup)
.TP
.B obliquity host add acme https://app.acme.test \-\-tech php \-\-server apache
add a host with metadata
.TP
.B obliquity host list acme
list a project's hosts
.SH STATEFUL OPTIONS (METASPLOIT\-STYLE)
Set options once, then run with no flags. Flags still override.
.TP
.B obliquity set fuzz endpoint /search
store an option on the active project
.TP
.B obliquity options fuzz
show a tool's options (OPTION/VALUE/REQUIRED/SOURCE)
.TP
.B obliquity unset fuzz endpoint
clear one option
.TP
.B obliquity project set\-gameplan bust generic\-deep
set the default gameplan for a tool
.SH BUST \-\- CONTENT DISCOVERY (FEROXBUSTER)
Staged directory/file discovery.
.TP
.B obliquity bust
list bust gameplans
.TP
.B obliquity bust run acme \-\-gameplan generic\-quick
run (host optional if only one)
.TP
.B obliquity bust run acme \-\-depth 3
override recursion depth
.TP
.B obliquity bust run acme \-\-filter\-status 404,500
drop noisy status codes
.TP
.B obliquity bust plan acme \-\-gameplan aspnet\-standard \-\-dry\-run
preview the exact commands
.TP
.B obliquity bust resume acme
skip completed stages, retry the rest
.SH FUZZ \-\- PARAMETER/API FUZZING (FFUF)
Fuzz parameter names/values or a raw request.
.TP
.B obliquity fuzz
list fuzz gameplans
.TP
.B obliquity fuzz run acme \-\-gameplan parameter\-names\-quick \-\-endpoint /search
fuzz parameter names
.TP
.B obliquity fuzz run acme \-\-gameplan parameter\-values\-quick \-\-template '/search?q=FUZZ'
fuzz a value
.TP
.B obliquity fuzz run acme \-\-gameplan api\-request\-quick \-\-request req.txt
fuzz inside a raw request
.SH CRACK \-\- OFFLINE HASH CRACKING (HASHCAT)
Staged password cracking against a hash file.
.TP
.B obliquity crack job add acme ./hashes.txt \-\-hash\-type 1000 \-\-name ntlm
add a hash file as a job
.TP
.B obliquity crack run acme \-\-gameplan quick\-dictionary
run a crackplan
.TP
.B obliquity crack resume acme \-\-gameplan standard
resume mid\-keyspace from hashcat's checkpoint
.SH BRUTE \-\- ONLINE LOGIN ATTACKS (THC\-HYDRA)
Live credential attacks against a service.
.TP
.B obliquity brute job add acme 10.0.0.5 \-\-service ssh \-\-name ssh\-box
add a login target
.TP
.B obliquity brute job add acme app.test \-\-service http\-post\-form \-\-form\-spec "/login:user=^USER^&pass=^PASS^:F=invalid"
web login form
.TP
.B obliquity brute run acme ssh\-box \-\-gameplan common\-creds
run a loginplan
.TP
.B obliquity brute creds acme
list recovered credentials
.SH WORDLISTS
A small downloadable catalog + an explorer.
.TP
.B obliquity wordlists list
show the catalog and install status
.TP
.B obliquity wordlists inspect raft\-medium\-files.txt
size, extensions, preview of a list
.TP
.B obliquity wordlists install seclists\-common rockyou
download catalog entries
.TP
.B obliquity explore
interactive TUI: browse gameplans + wordlists (Enter loads a gameplan)
.SH REPORTS & HISTORY
One shared database per project; several output formats.
.TP
.B obliquity coverage acme
what's been run per host/tool
.TP
.B obliquity history acme
unified log across all four pillars
.TP
.B obliquity report html acme \-\-open
generate + open the HTML report
.TP
.B obliquity report open acme
generate + open the HTML report in your default browser (any OS)
.TP
.B obliquity report json|csv|markdown acme
other export formats
.SH SEE ALSO
Full docs and source: https://github.com/naturalstate/obliquity
